   "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">DID301 · Section 0 · Lesson 0.4</span>\n<h2>Textbooks, materials & tools the university names</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Main textbook: <strong>Data Visualisation - A handbook for Data Driven Design</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Source: FLM · Syllabus ID 10711 · Decision 358/QĐ-ĐHFPT dated 03/04/2024 · collected 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">DID301 · Mục 0 · Bài 0.4</span>\n<h2>Giáo trình, tài liệu & công cụ trường quy định</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">Giáo trình chính: <strong>Data Visualisation - A handbook for Data Driven Design</strong>.</p>\n<p class=\"nhan\">Nguồn: FLM · Syllabus ID 10711 · QĐ 358/QĐ-ĐHFPT ngày 03/04/2024 · thu ngày 08/11/2026</p></div>\n<table>\n  <thead><tr><th>#</th><th>Material<br><small>Tài liệu</small></th><th>Author<br><small>Tác giả</small></th><th>Publisher<br><small>NXB</small></th><th>Year<br><small>Năm</small></th><th>Edition<br><small>Lần xuất bản</small></th><th>ISBN</th><th>Main<br><small>Chính</small></th><th>Hard copy<br><small>Bản in</small></th><th>Online</th><th>Note<br><small>Ghi chú</small></th></tr></thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr><td>1</td><td><strong>Data Visualisation - A handbook for Data Driven Design</strong></td><td>Andy Kirk</td><td>SAGE Publications</td><td>2019</td><td>2nd</td><td><code>9781526468925</code></td><td>✔</td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>2</td><td><strong>Visual Journalism, Infographics from the world's best newsrooms and design</strong></td><td>Javier Errea &amp; Gestalten</td><td>Gestalten</td><td>2017</td><td></td><td><code>978-3-89955-919-4</code></td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>3</td><td><strong>Information Graphic</strong></td><td>Sandra Rendgen, Julius Wiedemann</td><td>TASCHEN</td><td>2020</td><td></td><td><code>978-3836583831</code></td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>4</td><td><strong>History of Information Graphics</strong></td><td>Sandra Rendgen, Julius Wiedemann</td><td>TASCHEN</td><td>2019</td><td></td><td><code>978-3836567671</code></td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>5</td><td><strong>The Book of Circles: Visualizing Spheres of Knowledge: (with over 300 beautiful circular artworks, infographics and illustrations from across history)</strong></td><td>Manuel Lima</td><td>Princeton Architectural Press</td><td>2017</td><td>Illustrated edition</td><td><code>9781616895280</code></td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>6</td><td><strong>Information is beautifull</strong></td><td>David McCandless</td><td>Harper Collins Publishers</td><td>2013</td><td></td><td><code>978 000 7492893</code></td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>7</td><td><strong>Storytelling with data, Let's Practice!</strong></td><td>Cole Nussbaumer Knaflic</td><td>John Wiley &amp; Sons</td><td>2020</td><td></td><td><code>978-1-119-62149-2</code></td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>8</td><td><strong>Information Design Workbook, Revised and Updated: Graphic approaches, solutions, and inspiration + 30 case studies</strong></td><td>Kim Baer</td><td>‎Rockport Publishers</td><td>2021</td><td>Revised edition</td><td><code>978-0-2 ‎ 978-163159805031-19311-5</code></td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>9</td><td><strong>Cool Infographics, Effective Communication with Data Visualization and Design</strong></td><td>Randy Kru</td><td>John Wiley &amp; Sons</td><td>2013</td><td></td><td><code>978-1-118-58230-5</code></td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>10</td><td><strong>Data Sketches: A journey of imagination, exploration, and beautiful data visualizations (AK Peters Visualization Series)</strong></td><td>Nadieh Bremer, Shirley Wu</td><td>A K Peters/CRC Press</td><td>2021</td><td>1st</td><td><code>978-0367000080</code></td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>11</td><td><strong>Infographic, The power of Visual Stroryelling</strong></td><td>Jason Lankow, Josh Ritchie, Ross Crooks</td><td>John Wiley &amp; Sons</td><td>2012</td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td>—</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>12</td><td><strong>2. All relevant data visualizations: The digital companion site for the book, 'Visualising Data: A Handbook for Data Driven Design. <a href=\"http://book.visualisingdata.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">http://book.visualisingdata.com</a></strong></td><td>Internet</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>13</td><td><strong>All relevant data visualizations. Retrived from: <a href=\"https://datavizproject.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://datavizproject.com</a></strong></td><td>Internet</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>14</td><td><strong>An open source data visualization framework. Retrived from: <a href=\"https://rawgraphs.io/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://rawgraphs.io/</a></strong></td><td>Internet</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td></td></tr>\n    <tr><td>15</td><td><strong>Research and data to make progress against the world’s largest problems. Retrived from: <a href=\"https://ourworldindata.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://ourworldindata.org/</a></strong></td><td>Internet</td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td>—</td><td>—</td><td>✔</td><td></td></tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><h3>Tools</h3>\n<p><em>not published by the university</em></p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">Materials with no author/ISBN (slides, exercise packs…) are usually internal files you download inside FLM with your FPT account. Buy the exact <strong>edition</strong> listed — page and exercise numbers change between editions.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><h3>Công cụ</h3>\n<p><em>trường không công bố</em></p>\n<p class=\"ghi-chu\">Tài liệu không có tác giả/ISBN (slide, bộ bài tập…) thường là file nội bộ, tải trong FLM bằng tài khoản FPT. Mua đúng <strong>lần xuất bản</strong> ghi trong bảng — số trang, số bài tập đổi giữa các bản.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-en\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Everything in the tables above is copied <strong>verbatim</strong> from the university's FLM page (in English, as published) so you can check it against the copy your lecturer gives you: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=10711\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=10711</a> (needs your FPT login). If FLM publishes a newer syllabus, FLM wins.</div></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><div class=\"note-ct\">Mọi thứ trong các bảng trên được chép <strong>nguyên văn</strong> từ trang FLM của trường (bằng tiếng Anh, đúng như trường công bố) để bạn đối chiếu với bản giảng viên phát: <a href=\"https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=10711\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://flm.fpt.edu.vn/gui/role/student/SyllabusDetails?sylID=10711</a> (cần đăng nhập tài khoản FPT). Nếu FLM công bố bản syllabus mới hơn thì theo FLM.</div></div>"
